    exercise: 'Gather an empty stream and then request a window size of zero.', solution: 'An empty input produces no windows. A nonpositive window size is rejected. Test a one-element input and a partial final window as well as an exact multiple.',
    mistakes: 'Dropping the final partial window, assuming parallel support for arbitrary mutable state, or ignoring memory retained by a window or custom integrator.',
